三族。」遂入至內寢。胤尚與妾臥，默牽下斬之。出取胤僚佐張滿、荀楷等，誣以大逆。傳胤首于京師，詐作詔書，宜視內外。掠胤女及諸妾，並金寶還船。初云下都，俄而還，停胤故府，招桓宣、王愆期。愆期懼逼，勸默為平南、江州，默從之。愆期因逃廬山，桓宣固守不應。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p005:m0017"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按同段人物與次第核所屬卒事。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p004:m0020","surface":"劉胤","start":20,"end":22,"person_id":"rg5_13g_vsn","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p004","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p004:m0097","surface":"胤","start":97,"end":98,"person_id":"rg5_13g_vsn","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p004","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p004:m0121","surface":"胤","start":121,"end":122,"person_id":"rg5_13g_vsn","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p004","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p004:m0124","surface":"胤","start":124,"end":125,"person_id":"rg5_13g_vsn","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p004","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p005:m0017","surface":"胤","start":17,"end":18,"person_id":"rg5_13g_vsn","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p005","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p005:m0019","surface":"胤","start":19,"end":20,"person_id":"rg5_13g_vsn","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p005","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p005:m0041","surface":"胤","start":41,"end":42,"person_id":"rg5_13g_vsn","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p005","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p005:m0104","surface":"胤","start":104,"end":105,"person_id":"rg5_13g_vsn","kind":