-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-063-guomo-ws2025242"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p006","text":"司徒王導懼不可制，乃大赦天下，梟胤首於大航，以默為西中郎將、豫州刺史。武昌太守鄧岳馳白太尉陶侃，侃聞之，投袂起曰：「此必詐也。」即日率眾討默，上疏陳默罪惡。導聞之，乃收胤首，詔庾亮助侃討默。默欲南據豫章，而侃已至城下築土山以臨之。諸軍大集，圍之數重。侃惜默驍勇，欲活之，遣郭誦見默，默許降，而默將張醜、宋侯等恐為侃所殺，故致進退，不時得出。攻之轉急，宋侯遂縛默求降，即斬於軍門，同黨死者四十人，傳首京師。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":81,"last_line":81,"raw_start":7279,"raw_end":7483,"raw_character_offsets":[7281,7282,7283,7284,7285,7286,7287,7288,7289,7290,7291,7292,7293,7294,7295,7296,7297,7298,7299,7300,7301,7302,7303,7304,7305,7306,7307,7308,7309,7310,7311,7312,7313,7314,7315,7316,7317,7318,7319,7320,7321,7322,7323,7324,7325,7326,7327,7328,7329,7330,7331,7332,7333,7334,7335,7336,7337,7338,7339,7340,7341,7342,7343,7344,7345,7346,7347,7348,7349,7350,7351,7352,7353,7354,7355,7356,7357,7358,7359,7360,7361,7362,7363,7364,7365,7366,7367,7368,7369,7370,7371,7372,7373,7374,7375,7376,7377,7378,7379,7380,7381,7382,7383,7384,7385,7386,7387,7388,7389,7390,7391,7392,7393,7394,7395,7396,7397,7398,7399,7400,7401,7402,7403,7404,7405,7406,7407,7408,7409,7410,7411,7412,7413,7414,7415,7416,7417,7418,7419,7420,7421,7422,7423,7424,7425,7426,7427,7428,7429,7430,7431,7432,7433,7434,7435,7436,7437,7438,7439,7440,7441,7442,7443,7444,7445,7446,7447,7448,7449,7450,7451,7452,7453,7454,7455,7456,7457,7458,7459,7460,7461,7462,7463,7464,7465,7466,7467,7468,7469,7470,7471,7472,7473,7474,7475,7476,7477,7478,7479,7480,7481,7482],"revision_id":2025242},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p006:m0002","surface":"王導","start":2,"end":4,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p006:m0016","surface":"胤","start":16,"end":17,"person_id":"rg5_13g_vsn","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p006:m0023","surface":"默","start":23,"end":24,"person_id":"799_f6c_778","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-063-guomo:p006:m0039