u-066-taokan","book_id":"b-jinshu-066","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-066-taokan-ws1527632"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line026","text":"時制王敦綱紀除名，參佐禁固，嶠上疏曰：「王敦剛愎不仁，忍行殺戮，親任小人，疎遠君子，朝廷所不能抑，骨肉所不能間。處其朝者恒懼危亡，故人士結舌，道路以目，誠賢人君子道窮數盡，遵養時晦之辰也。且敦為大逆之日，拘錄人士，自免無路，原其私心，豈遑晏處，如陸玩、羊曼、劉胤、蔡謨、郭璞常與臣言，備知之矣。必其凶悖，自可罪人斯得；如其枉入姦黨，宜施之以寬。加以玩等之誠，聞於聖聽，當受同賊之責，實負其心。陛下仁聖含弘，思求允中；臣階緣博納，干非其事，誠在愛才，不忘忠益。」帝從之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line026:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"王敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line026:m0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"嶠","kind":"person","person_id":"6v8_pk9_7k5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line026:m0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"王敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line026:m0095","start":95,"end":96,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line026:m0123","start":123,"end":125,"surface":"陸玩","kind":"person","person_id":"u3v_t2p_tcu","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line026:m0126","start":126,"end":128,"surface":"羊曼","kind":"person","person_id":"n5l_y9p_afh","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line026:m0129","start":129,"end":131,"surface":"劉胤","kind":"person","person_id":"rg5_13g_vsn","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line026:m0132","start":132,"end":134,"surface":"蔡謨","kind":"person","person_id":"b98_957_r7h","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:lin